WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:05.440
Unless One Piece pulls a major final twist
that ends the story in absolute tragedy, we

00:00:05.440 --> 00:00:10.349
can pretty much say for certain that Luffy
will become pirate king, defeat the big baddies

00:00:10.349 --> 00:00:12.170
and change the world.

00:00:12.170 --> 00:00:13.170
But…then what?

00:00:13.170 --> 00:00:17.420
What is going to happen to all of the straw
hats and, most importantly, what will the

00:00:17.420 --> 00:00:22.930
one piece world look like 10 years after the
world is saved?

00:00:22.930 --> 00:00:28.300
Luckily we know exactly what many of our favorite
characters would probably be up to based on

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:31.689
their dreams and foreshadowing in the story.

00:00:31.689 --> 00:00:37.850
Like Sanji who will have found the All Blue,
and Robin who will finally learn the true

00:00:37.850 --> 00:00:39.260
history of the world.

00:00:39.260 --> 00:00:44.739
And then there’s Luffy who at this point
will have actually already achieved his dream,

00:00:44.739 --> 00:00:49.710
and if we are being honest my personal bet
is that Luffy actually dies at the end of

00:00:49.710 --> 00:00:58.059
the story because he is kinda like this Jesus
figure who sacrifices himself to save everyone.

00:00:58.059 --> 00:01:05.369
But let’s stay positive and assume that
he survives, like maybe Chopper somehow heals

00:01:05.369 --> 00:01:10.090
all the lifespan he has lost, and now he is
the freest man in the world.

00:01:10.090 --> 00:01:15.009
Which takes us ten years into the future,
where Luffy is about to set out on his next

00:01:15.009 --> 00:01:16.009
major adventure.

00:01:16.009 --> 00:01:19.840
So he steps out of his family’s home on
New Dawn Island.

00:01:19.840 --> 00:01:22.500
And what is this new, unheard of island?

00:01:22.500 --> 00:01:27.500
Well, it’s a new island formed after the
collapse of the Red Line where all the races

00:01:27.500 --> 00:01:30.600
of the world have basically come to live together.

00:01:30.600 --> 00:01:34.650
And this island is insane!

00:01:34.650 --> 00:01:40.490
The main part&nbsp; is jam packed with houses
and a massive party area in the center.

00:01:40.490 --> 00:01:46.119
Because of course, it’s Luffy’s island
and what else would he rather do but party

00:01:46.119 --> 00:01:47.440
with all of his friends.

00:01:47.440 --> 00:01:51.040
Speaking of those friends, here’s a shocker
for you.

00:01:51.040 --> 00:01:56.119
Luffy is married AND has a four year old daughter
named Lily.

00:01:56.119 --> 00:02:01.130
But we’ll save the surprise of who actually
tied this rubber man down for a bit later.

00:02:01.130 --> 00:02:04.119
Because for now Luffy is on a mission.

00:02:04.119 --> 00:02:09.069
He wants to throw a massive party for his
kid’s fifth birthday, so that of course

00:02:09.069 --> 00:02:11.020
means inviting his friends.

00:02:11.020 --> 00:02:12.190
ALL OF HIS FRIENDS.

00:02:12.190 --> 00:02:14.480
But of course there is ONE.

00:02:14.480 --> 00:02:15.480
BIG.

00:02:15.480 --> 00:02:16.480
PROBLEM.

00:02:16.480 --> 00:02:20.140
Only SOME of the former straw hat pirates
actually live on the island.

00:02:20.140 --> 00:02:21.140
Which ones?

00:02:21.140 --> 00:02:25.500
Well, we’ll see in just a moment as Luffy
leaves home with just his straw hat and a

00:02:25.500 --> 00:02:31.190
bag full of invitations, but before setting
out, he has a few invitations to deliver around

00:02:31.190 --> 00:02:32.190
the island.

00:02:32.190 --> 00:02:37.530
And on his way, we can see what an incredibly
diverse place New Dawn Island has become.

00:02:37.530 --> 00:02:42.140
That’s because many of the people that Luffy
befriended on his journey to become pirate

00:02:42.140 --> 00:02:45.159
king now live here on the island.

00:02:45.159 --> 00:02:50.909
There are fishmen, minks, mermaids, giants,
tontattas, Skypieans, all going about their

00:02:50.909 --> 00:02:55.360
business within the various districts of the
town which are filled with shops and restaurants

00:02:55.360 --> 00:02:57.280
from all across the one piece world.

00:02:57.280 --> 00:03:03.430
There is even an amusement park and a giant
music area in the very center of the island.

00:03:03.430 --> 00:03:08.760
Which is EXACTLY what you would expect Luffy’s
island would look like.

00:03:08.760 --> 00:03:11.060
So now let’s explore the rest of the island.

00:03:11.060 --> 00:03:14.409
So Luffy hops over to the first of these mini
islands.

00:03:14.409 --> 00:03:19.209
And these are actually super cool because
they house some of his closest friends.

00:03:19.209 --> 00:03:24.569
This one right here closest to Luffy’s house
is actually Sanji, and his wife Pudding’s,

00:03:24.569 --> 00:03:26.790
world-famous, five-star restaurant.

00:03:26.790 --> 00:03:31.370
This restaurant is basically the completion
of Sanji’s dream, since New Dawn Island

00:03:31.370 --> 00:03:36.980
is located right in the middle of the famous
All Blue - which is where all four seas joined

00:03:36.980 --> 00:03:37.980
together.

00:03:37.980 --> 00:03:43.720
And while we don’t know for sure that this
will happen in the main story, I personally

00:03:43.720 --> 00:03:49.500
think it is pretty likely that the Red Line
will be destroyed, at least the part where

00:03:49.500 --> 00:03:55.180
Reverse Mountain is - because I mean come
on, it is basically X marks the spot.

00:03:55.180 --> 00:04:00.420
And if this part is destroyed that will leave
space for New Dawn Island to form out of the

00:04:00.420 --> 00:04:01.420
rubble.

00:04:01.420 --> 00:04:05.230
So Luffy swings straight through the front
door, pops his first invitation into Sanji’s

00:04:05.230 --> 00:04:11.120
chef hat, and then grabs ALL OF THE FOOD that
Sanji and his chefs have SPENT HOURS preparing

00:04:11.120 --> 00:04:14.739
and stuffs it into a giant sack for his long
trip around the world.

00:04:14.739 --> 00:04:21.310
At first Sanji is furious and he runs after
Luffy but after he stops to read the invitation

00:04:21.310 --> 00:04:22.710
he just smiles.

00:04:22.710 --> 00:04:25.180
That’s one straw hat down.

00:04:25.180 --> 00:04:26.470
Many more to go.

00:04:26.470 --> 00:04:31.710
Luffy’s next stop is this little island,
which is home to two world famous buildings.

00:04:31.710 --> 00:04:37.139
The first is a university founded by the greatest
archeologist in the world, Nico Robin.

00:04:37.139 --> 00:04:41.930
She created this place with her good buddy
Saul so that anyone who wanted to study archeology

00:04:41.930 --> 00:04:44.840
and the ancient past could gather here to
learn.

00:04:44.840 --> 00:04:49.880
But as Luffy barges into Robin’s office
he finds that she is apparently out on some

00:04:49.880 --> 00:04:51.770
grand expedition.

00:04:51.770 --> 00:04:56.340
So add her to the list of ones to find out
in the world.

00:04:56.340 --> 00:05:01.370
So then he hops over to the hospital on the
other half of the island where Dr. Chopper

00:05:01.370 --> 00:05:04.710
and Dr. Law can basically cure any disease.

00:05:04.710 --> 00:05:09.680
They even have a super cool bird ambulance
system which can bring in patients from all

00:05:09.680 --> 00:05:10.680
over the world.

00:05:10.680 --> 00:05:13.620
But that’s now Chopper and Law both invited.

00:05:13.620 --> 00:05:14.620
Check.

00:05:14.620 --> 00:05:19.569
Next up is this middle island, which is actually
where many of the patients of the hospital

00:05:19.569 --> 00:05:20.569
come from.

00:05:20.569 --> 00:05:21.569
Why is that?

00:05:21.569 --> 00:05:26.510
Well, it’s because this island houses Jinbe’s
fishman karate school, where he trains anyone

00:05:26.510 --> 00:05:31.340
who wants to learn how to fight alongside
this former fishman revolutionary.

00:05:31.340 --> 00:05:37.000
So that’s Jinbe invited, and on the same
island is the massive Never Lost dojo, where

00:05:37.000 --> 00:05:39.840
anyone can come learn the way of the sword.

00:05:39.840 --> 00:05:44.720
And this place is super cool because Zoro
actually hosts monthly tournaments for anyone

00:05:44.720 --> 00:05:48.770
wanting to challenge his title as the world’s
strongest swordsman.

00:05:48.770 --> 00:05:53.030
Which if we’re being honest it is probably
good that people come to him because we all

00:05:53.030 --> 00:05:58.900
know he’d get lost trying to find strong
opponents.

00:05:58.900 --> 00:06:01.870
But for some reason he is also off of the
island.

00:06:01.870 --> 00:06:05.370
I wonder what he is doing out in the world…

00:06:05.370 --> 00:06:09.130
After leaving the dojo, Luffy flies over to
the brightest of the little islands, which

00:06:09.130 --> 00:06:13.650
is funnily enough called Golden island - hmm,
wonder who named it that.

00:06:13.650 --> 00:06:15.210
Guess we’ll find out soon enough.

00:06:15.210 --> 00:06:20.380
On this island is a massive casino run by
the former Warlord Crocodile, and when Luffy

00:06:20.380 --> 00:06:27.580
goes inside he finds his old mentor Rayleigh
hanging out with his gambling buddy, Kizaru.

00:06:27.580 --> 00:06:31.669
Apparently after the light fruit user left
the marines, these two quickly became friends.

00:06:31.669 --> 00:06:35.940
Plus Kizaru’s light speed is super helpful
whenever Rayleigh needs to escape whenever

00:06:35.940 --> 00:06:39.349
his longtime lover demands he actually brings
home some money.

00:06:39.349 --> 00:06:43.430
And right next to the Casino is the local
branch of the Tangerine Bank.

00:06:43.430 --> 00:06:46.990
And who is the head of this bank?

00:06:46.990 --> 00:06:53.889
Well, none other than the grown up O-tama
who trained under a certain cat burglar we

00:06:53.889 --> 00:06:54.889
know and love.

00:06:54.889 --> 00:06:56.970
But why is she running a bank?

00:06:56.970 --> 00:06:59.560
Keep watching to find out later on.

00:06:59.560 --> 00:07:06.180
Now there’s one more stop before Luffy leaves,
and that is the Research Lab on this final

00:07:06.180 --> 00:07:07.470
island right here.

00:07:07.470 --> 00:07:13.430
And this is where all the fun starts because
as soon as Luffy arrives a massive explosion

00:07:13.430 --> 00:07:15.040
shakes the island.

00:07:15.040 --> 00:07:18.919
Out of the smoke comes a giant version of
his Grandpa Garp.

00:07:18.919 --> 00:07:24.090
Luffy is actually super excited to see a mega-sized
Garp, but that instantly changes when his

00:07:24.090 --> 00:07:27.650
grandpa’s massive fist comes rushing straight
towards him.

00:07:27.650 --> 00:07:33.081
But just as the fist is about to crush Luffy,
it explodes into flashing lights and sparks.

00:07:33.081 --> 00:07:38.979
Then out of the smoke comes the genius scientist
Dr. Vegapunk, who can’t stop from laughing

00:07:38.979 --> 00:07:40.780
at his hologram prank.

00:07:40.780 --> 00:07:47.790
You see, Vegapunk set up shop here on New
Dawn Island, and even though he doesn’t

00:07:47.790 --> 00:07:53.979
get all the funding from the government that
he used to he can still make some pretty cool

00:07:53.979 --> 00:07:56.009
stuff to help out the world.

00:07:56.009 --> 00:08:00.849
Luffy will definitely spend some time playing
around with some of Vegapunk’s fun new technology,

00:08:00.849 --> 00:08:05.639
which you can actually see in use all over
the town, and then Luffy leaves him with some

00:08:05.639 --> 00:08:07.220
instructions for the party.

00:08:07.220 --> 00:08:11.310
And with that, Luffy jumps over to the other
side of the main island.

00:08:11.310 --> 00:08:14.270
He stops by Usopp’s house, but he is also
curiously missing.

00:08:14.270 --> 00:08:18.740
Then he flies past the tiny new government
building that no one cares about and skips

00:08:18.740 --> 00:08:24.350
right to the new Franky Family inc warehouse,
which is where Franky comes up with all of

00:08:24.350 --> 00:08:26.240
his crazy inventions.

00:08:26.240 --> 00:08:32.800
And the most important of those is the new
and improved Sea Train, which is currently

00:08:32.800 --> 00:08:35.459
leaving the station at warp speed.

00:08:35.459 --> 00:08:40.039
Luffy somehow manages to stretch and grab
on, and his new adventure to invite all of

00:08:40.039 --> 00:08:41.680
his friends is now fully underway.

00:08:41.680 --> 00:08:46.850
And as he leaves, a giant hologram of his
face appears in the sky above the island,

00:08:46.850 --> 00:08:51.060
announcing his daughter’s birthday party
to everyone on the island.

00:08:51.060 --> 00:08:54.950
A massive cheer goes up, and Luffy smiles.

00:08:54.950 --> 00:08:57.910
Seems like Vegapunk understood his message
just fine.

00:08:57.910 --> 00:09:03.570
However, despite how awesome Luffy’s home
island is, he is really excited to head out

00:09:03.570 --> 00:09:06.390
to sea after so much time on land.

00:09:06.390 --> 00:09:11.959
Plus there’s six other former crewmates
and A TON of other important friends to find

00:09:11.959 --> 00:09:13.180
out in the world.

00:09:13.180 --> 00:09:17.860
Which brings us to a super important part
of this scenario…

00:09:17.860 --> 00:09:22.190
Now that we are setting out into the world,
we need to know what exactly happened to the

00:09:22.190 --> 00:09:24.209
world after Luffy became pirate king?

00:09:24.209 --> 00:09:29.660
Well, while we don't know for certain, there
are a few things that will most likely happen

00:09:29.660 --> 00:09:31.620
at the end of the story.

00:09:31.620 --> 00:09:35.260
Luffy will find the One Piece and become pirate
king.

00:09:35.260 --> 00:09:41.880
He will take down the corrupt world nobles
and bring the dawn to the world, which basically

00:09:41.880 --> 00:09:44.300
means set the world free.

00:09:44.300 --> 00:09:50.080
These few things are basically guaranteed
to happen - unless Oda-sensei pulls some crazy

00:09:50.080 --> 00:09:51.450
twist that no one is expecting.

00:09:51.450 --> 00:09:59.240
And I’m sure it will be super easy to find
a perfect political system to rule an entire

00:09:59.240 --> 00:10:04.209
planet, but for now let’s assume that there
is a new government that works way better

00:10:04.209 --> 00:10:05.210
than the last one.

00:10:05.210 --> 00:10:10.790
There are still pirates - even bad pirates
- but the good pirates and marines do a good

00:10:10.790 --> 00:10:13.420
job of keeping them from doing too much damage.

00:10:13.420 --> 00:10:17.930
And with Luffy having such a diverse crew,
there is much less discrimination against

00:10:17.930 --> 00:10:19.570
other races in the world.

00:10:19.570 --> 00:10:24.880
Which is actually part of Franky’s purpose
for creating the new Sea Train, which will

00:10:24.880 --> 00:10:27.589
eventually connect the entire world.

00:10:27.589 --> 00:10:32.420
And this is super important for Luffy’s
current journey because as we all know Luffy

00:10:32.420 --> 00:10:35.660
could never get anywhere sailing on his own..

00:10:35.660 --> 00:10:44.399
The first stop after New Dawn Island is Elbaf,
where Luffy brings some invitations for the

00:10:44.399 --> 00:10:46.450
new leaders of the giants.

00:10:46.450 --> 00:10:51.510
These days not only giants live here because
after making friends with Usopp they are open

00:10:51.510 --> 00:10:54.160
to anyone who wants to become a brave warrior.

00:10:54.160 --> 00:10:59.899
Luffy was also hoping to find Shanks and Usopp
here, but it seems that the giants haven’t

00:10:59.899 --> 00:11:05.820
seen Shanks in a while and Usopp is out adventuring
with his dad.

00:11:05.820 --> 00:11:12.800
Finally, it took ten years for the dead-beat
dad pirates to actually spend time with their

00:11:12.800 --> 00:11:13.800
kids.

00:11:13.800 --> 00:11:17.620
So back on the train, Luffy's next stop is
Wano.

00:11:17.620 --> 00:11:21.040
But suddenly a massive explosion rocks the
train.

00:11:21.040 --> 00:11:25.900
The train is fine, because I mean Franky made
it and have you seen the kind of stuff he

00:11:25.900 --> 00:11:26.900
makes?

00:11:26.900 --> 00:11:31.230
But Luffy looks out the window and he sees
this massive ship speeding toward the train.

00:11:31.230 --> 00:11:37.280
And while other passengers freak out, Luffy
is thrilled to see Buggy, who is the new ruler

00:11:37.280 --> 00:11:38.810
of Pirate Island.

00:11:38.810 --> 00:11:43.970
However, Buggy seems determined to take out
the train and Luffy comes out to stop him.

00:11:43.970 --> 00:11:48.430
However, as Luffy is about to charge up a
Gomu Gomu no attack, he hears an incredibly

00:11:48.430 --> 00:11:51.399
familiar voice shouting from on top of the
train.

00:11:51.399 --> 00:11:55.610
He turns around and is ABSOLUTELY shocked
to find his four year old daughter, Lily,

00:11:55.610 --> 00:11:59.579
shouting insults at the Buggy pirates across
the waves.

00:11:59.579 --> 00:12:04.760
Before he can stop her, she jumps up, catches
a cannon ball and throws it back at the oncoming

00:12:04.760 --> 00:12:05.760
ship.

00:12:05.760 --> 00:12:09.870
Which sounds ridiculous, but this is Luffy’s
kid after all.

00:12:09.870 --> 00:12:14.550
Then out of nowhere, a giant ship from Elbaf
appears, and cuts off Buggy’s ship, allowing

00:12:14.550 --> 00:12:18.270
the train to continue on without Luffy having
to even fight.

00:12:18.270 --> 00:12:24.130
Because that is actually part of the allied
countries' jobs to protect the sea train route.

00:12:24.130 --> 00:12:28.870
But now that his kid is on board, all he can
do is laugh and take her along for the ride.

00:12:28.870 --> 00:12:34.560
Though, I’d bet Luffy’s wife is not going
to be happy AT ALL when they return.

00:12:34.560 --> 00:12:36.350
Anyways, onto the land of the samurai.

00:12:36.350 --> 00:12:41.280
Here Momo is still the Shogun and the borders
have finally been opened to the rest of the

00:12:41.280 --> 00:12:42.280
world.

00:12:42.280 --> 00:12:46.779
And here is where we find our favorite green-haired
swordsman, because apparently his wife, who

00:12:46.779 --> 00:12:51.480
is Momo’s sister Hiyori, dragged him back
to her home to see her family.

00:12:51.480 --> 00:12:56.329
But when Luffy tells him about the party,
he cannot resist the invitation and even decides

00:12:56.329 --> 00:13:01.600
to join the journey to find the other crewmates,
so cross another one off the list.

00:13:01.600 --> 00:13:06.890
But that’s not all to see in Wano because
Luffy’s old marine rivals, Smoker and Tashigi,

00:13:06.890 --> 00:13:11.570
now run an orphanage and a sword museum, where
Tashigi shows off all of the famous blades

00:13:11.570 --> 00:13:14.700
that they have collected from bad pirates
over the years.

00:13:14.700 --> 00:13:20.130
Because where else would you have a sword
museum except the place that literally makes

00:13:20.130 --> 00:13:22.649
the best blades in the world.

00:13:22.649 --> 00:13:25.480
The next stop is Whole Cake Island.

00:13:25.480 --> 00:13:30.860
These islands used to be the home of the Emperor
Big Mom, but now our donut loving mochi man,

00:13:30.860 --> 00:13:35.360
Katakuri, has created a ton of world famous
bakeries on the many islands of Totto Land.

00:13:35.360 --> 00:13:39.990
And that’s because originally these islands
were all themed around food like chocolate

00:13:39.990 --> 00:13:44.970
and fluffy cakes, so it is only natural that
Katakuri would want to take all these resources

00:13:44.970 --> 00:13:48.660
to make the absolute best sweets in the entire
world.

00:13:48.660 --> 00:13:53.450
Of course he really just wants to eat them
all himself, but he would definitely share

00:13:53.450 --> 00:13:56.120
when Luffy and the gang come to drop off an
invitation.

00:13:56.120 --> 00:14:01.149
So after losing to Lily in a sweet’s eating
contest, they all take the train to Dressrosa.

00:14:01.149 --> 00:14:06.150
And I’m actually starting to wonder if we
will find any of the other straw hats here.

00:14:06.150 --> 00:14:10.709
Once they land, they see that the island has
been rebuilt and the tribe of dwarves who

00:14:10.709 --> 00:14:16.149
helped save the kingdom from the evil warlord
Doflamingo ten years ago are now a full part

00:14:16.149 --> 00:14:17.399
of the kingdom.

00:14:17.399 --> 00:14:21.280
Luffy invites all of his friends to the party,
and then gives special instructions to Leo,

00:14:21.280 --> 00:14:26.320
the leader of the Tontattas, to pass out invitations
to the rest of the Straw Hat Grand Fleet.

00:14:26.320 --> 00:14:31.370
But, as we will see at the end of this video,
this actually creates a huge problem for Luffy,

00:14:31.370 --> 00:14:33.089
as we’ll discuss later on.

00:14:33.089 --> 00:14:38.990
By this time about a week has passed, and
we’ve reached the exact opposite side of

00:14:38.990 --> 00:14:39.990
the world.

00:14:39.990 --> 00:14:44.150
Which may seem super fast to travel as far
as they have, but remember this Sea Train

00:14:44.150 --> 00:14:48.940
was made by Franky, so of course it is Suuuppper
fast.

00:14:48.940 --> 00:14:54.240
And between adventuring on islands and practicing
swords with her uncle, Lily is having the

00:14:54.240 --> 00:14:58.220
time of her life, but we’ve only found Zoro
so far.

00:14:58.220 --> 00:14:59.600
Where is everyone else?

00:14:59.600 --> 00:15:01.000
And how about Luffy’s brother?

00:15:01.000 --> 00:15:02.000
And his dad?

00:15:02.000 --> 00:15:03.189
What are they all doing?

00:15:03.189 --> 00:15:07.730
But in this super important location, which
used to be where Mary Geoise was located is

00:15:07.730 --> 00:15:13.610
this new island right here is also the headquarters
of the newly established government of the

00:15:13.610 --> 00:15:15.290
world.

00:15:15.290 --> 00:15:19.019
After the fall of the previous government,
the world basically just took out the Celestial

00:15:19.019 --> 00:15:24.740
Dragons and other evil rulers and made some
new system of government with elected officials

00:15:24.740 --> 00:15:27.589
from allied kingdoms and even some pirate
crews.

00:15:27.589 --> 00:15:32.910
And while the system is not perfect - let’s
be honest no government is - Luffy’s brother

00:15:32.910 --> 00:15:38.670
Sabo now spends his days basically watching
over it to make sure any corruption is stamped

00:15:38.670 --> 00:15:39.670
out.

00:15:39.670 --> 00:15:43.160
At least that is what he is supposed to be
doing when he’s not chowing down on delivery

00:15:43.160 --> 00:15:45.790
orders of Sanji’s famous ramen.

00:15:45.790 --> 00:15:50.500
However, Sabo agrees to take time off, and
Luffy also drops off an invitation for the

00:15:50.500 --> 00:15:52.910
new marine admiral Koby as well.

00:15:52.910 --> 00:15:57.220
However, as great as it is to see his brother,
Luffy doesn’t care to stick around the government

00:15:57.220 --> 00:16:00.990
for long, so they quickly hop back on the
train and continue their adventure.

00:16:00.990 --> 00:16:05.560
Which takes them back to the location of the
original Sea Train on Water 7, where surely

00:16:05.560 --> 00:16:08.160
we have to meet another straw hat.

00:16:08.160 --> 00:16:12.910
Now this island is completely different from
when we visited in the original story.

00:16:12.910 --> 00:16:16.030
And that’s because it isn’t even an island
anymore.

00:16:16.030 --> 00:16:19.160
Remember that Water 7 was sinking because
of these giant waves.

00:16:19.160 --> 00:16:24.190
But that is no longer an issue because together
Franky and the mayor of Water 7 Iceberg finally

00:16:24.190 --> 00:16:28.910
managed to transform the entire city into
a giant floating ship.

00:16:28.910 --> 00:16:32.870
Franky has of course also decked out his former
home with some fun new technology, but the

00:16:32.870 --> 00:16:38.670
most incredible invention of all is a fleet
of massive balloons which allow people to

00:16:38.670 --> 00:16:40.350
safely reach Skypiea.

00:16:40.350 --> 00:16:45.240
Which is exactly where the gang heads next
and it is up in the clouds that they FINALLY

00:16:45.240 --> 00:16:47.070
meet up with some old friends.

00:16:47.070 --> 00:16:52.209
That’s because Usopp and Yasopp are having
a friendly sniping competition trying to snipe

00:16:52.209 --> 00:16:57.680
the golden bell from miles away, but right
next to them is one of the few honorary Straw

00:16:57.680 --> 00:16:58.680
Hats, Yamato.

00:16:58.680 --> 00:17:02.800
That’s right, Yamato has finally gotten
out to explore the world, just like she promised

00:17:02.800 --> 00:17:04.160
at the end of the Wano arc.

00:17:04.160 --> 00:17:06.540
And boy is she happy to see Luffy.

00:17:06.540 --> 00:17:11.350
In fact, after their competition they all
drop off some invitations with their Skypiean

00:17:11.350 --> 00:17:16.500
friends and then Usopp and Yamato – yes
for real this time – both join the group

00:17:16.500 --> 00:17:18.429
and head back down to the surface.

00:17:18.429 --> 00:17:20.860
We’ve finally got some other straw hats
on board.

00:17:20.860 --> 00:17:24.920
I am seriously hoping the others didn’t
die or something.

00:17:24.920 --> 00:17:29.000
However, there is one major problem coming
up ahead.

00:17:29.000 --> 00:17:31.590
And that’s because the train doesn’t continue
forever.

00:17:31.590 --> 00:17:36.990
You see when the train reaches the end of
the tracks, the group finally finds Franky

00:17:36.990 --> 00:17:41.830
who is working with his new crew of cyborg
construction workers to complete the Sea Train

00:17:41.830 --> 00:17:42.830
tracks.

00:17:42.830 --> 00:17:47.070
But no train means no more free rides, but
this isn’t an issue for long because Franky

00:17:47.070 --> 00:17:48.840
has the Thousand Sunny.

00:17:48.840 --> 00:17:54.340
So when Luffy asks, Franky of course agrees
to come with them on their trip, so the gang,

00:17:54.340 --> 00:17:57.370
along with our Super Cyborg, continue onward.

00:17:57.370 --> 00:18:01.059
Which brings us to Alabasta, where its basically
raining down straw hats.

00:18:01.059 --> 00:18:04.010
Alabsata has actually become a world famous
hot spring destination.

00:18:04.010 --> 00:18:05.980
Thanks a bunch, Gedatsu.

00:18:05.980 --> 00:18:11.690
Vivi is currently ruling the kingdom after
her dad passed away, but politics are not

00:18:11.690 --> 00:18:16.890
currently on her mind at all because she is
rocking out at a concert for the worldwide

00:18:16.890 --> 00:18:19.160
musical phenomenon, Soul King Brook.

00:18:19.160 --> 00:18:23.330
That’s right, our straw hat skeleton has
gone back to being a rockstar and he travels

00:18:23.330 --> 00:18:25.570
the world with his whale friend, Laboon.

00:18:25.570 --> 00:18:29.809
He’s not the only former straw hat here
though, because Robin is also enjoying the

00:18:29.809 --> 00:18:33.929
concert while taking a break from studying
in the Royal Alabasta Library.

00:18:33.929 --> 00:18:38.940
So after enjoying the concert, Vivi, Brook,
and Robin all join with the crew, and together

00:18:38.940 --> 00:18:44.040
- with Laboon tailing behind - they set out
for what used to be East Blue.

00:18:44.040 --> 00:18:49.020
And here they enter the domain of the mega-rich
bank CEO, Nami.

00:18:49.020 --> 00:18:53.280
Which might surprise you, but after finishing
her map of the entire world, Nami sold her

00:18:53.280 --> 00:18:56.909
completed navigational charts and made a massive
fortune.

00:18:56.909 --> 00:19:01.330
She then took that money, started a world
wide banking group, Tangerine Banks and has

00:19:01.330 --> 00:19:04.570
basically become the richest person in the
entire world.

00:19:04.570 --> 00:19:09.220
I guess she doesn’t need to charge her friends
300% interest anymore.

00:19:09.220 --> 00:19:13.490
She even has bought everyone in her hometown
a massive mansion to pay back all of the trouble

00:19:13.490 --> 00:19:14.840
she caused as a kid.

00:19:14.840 --> 00:19:18.890
But when her friends arrive, Luffy’s former
Navigator drops everything to give Lily a

00:19:18.890 --> 00:19:23.289
giant hug, and then she immediately takes
over sailing the ship with the crew.

00:19:23.289 --> 00:19:28.000
Which is all of the crew, but there are still
some super important friends to find.

00:19:28.000 --> 00:19:31.480
And the next stop is Luffy’s hometown, the
former Goa Kingdom.

00:19:31.480 --> 00:19:35.240
However, upon arrival they immediately run
into trouble.

00:19:35.240 --> 00:19:38.760
Cannon balls start splashing down everywhere
around the ship.

00:19:38.760 --> 00:19:44.299
And that’s because Luffy’s Grandpa Garp
is chucking the missiles at the ship from

00:19:44.299 --> 00:19:49.770
the shore, while Luffy’s dad Dragon lounges
nearby eating his favorite greasy sandwiches.

00:19:49.770 --> 00:19:54.380
But after they land and Lily proceeds to beat
up her great-grandpa, Luffy invites the two

00:19:54.380 --> 00:19:56.980
to the party back on New Dawn Island.

00:19:56.980 --> 00:20:01.799
Shanks also comes down to meet the gang at
the beach, and he is joined by the barkeeper

00:20:01.799 --> 00:20:06.080
Makino and their own boy who is now around
ten years old.

00:20:06.080 --> 00:20:11.210
And of course, it is entirely possible that
not all of these three super powerful fighters

00:20:11.210 --> 00:20:16.500
are still alive, but for now we don’t know
so I’m just going to add them in anyways.

00:20:16.500 --> 00:20:20.840
Now, with all the invitations delivered it
is time to head back to New Dawn Island, where

00:20:20.840 --> 00:20:25.270
with all of his friends reunited he throws
one of the greatest parties the world has

00:20:25.270 --> 00:20:30.550
ever seen to celebrate Lily’s birthday.

00:20:30.550 --> 00:20:34.380
Which is of course the BEST case scenario
for what could happen after One Piece, but

00:20:34.380 --> 00:20:38.659
what if things actually went horribly wrong
for Luffy and his friends.

00:20:38.659 --> 00:20:44.169
And instead of becoming pirate king, Luffy
was instead captured and sentenced to be executed

00:20:44.169 --> 00:20:45.320
by the world government.

00:20:45.320 --> 00:20:49.330
Which is absolutely insane to think about
all of the people who would come to rescue

00:20:49.330 --> 00:20:53.360
him that I just had to make an entire video
to see if Luffy would actually survive.

00:20:53.360 --> 00:20:55.160
And you can watch that right here.

00:20:55.160 --> 00:20:58.099
Shanks for watching and I’ll see you in
the next one.

